== A. Load configuration and reject invalid startup ==
User -[#1565C0]> App : [call] start karta-metrics-exporter\n--config exporter.yaml
App -[#7B1FA2]> App : [decision] defaults < YAML < environment < explicit flags
App -[#1565C0]> App : [call] validate selectors, duration bounds,\nresource rules, sources and label limits
note right of App
Defaults: refresh 45s; maxAge 2m;
request timeout 30s; workers 2;
shared API QPS 20 / burst 40.
maxAge must exceed refreshInterval.
end note
alt invalid config / Kubernetes config / CEL compile failure
  App --[#388E3C]> User : [result] return error; main logs and exits 1
else valid configuration
  App -[#1565C0]> App : [call] signal context; BuildConfigFromFlags\nconfigure Kubernetes clients
end

== B. Construct one dependency graph before serving ==
App -[#1565C0]> Reader : [call] dynamic + metadata clients; deferred REST mapper\nshared API token bucket; TTL=maxAge
App -[#1565C0]> Inventory : [call] New(selected catalog; cluster source policy)
Inventory -[#7B1FA2]> Inventory : [decision] validate catalog names; select entries\ncluster snapshot initially empty
App -[#1565C0]> Discovery : [call] New(Reader, ignoredOwnerKinds)
App -[#1565C0]> Labels : [call] validate rule names / metrics / sources\ncompile CEL once per configured rule
Labels --[#388E3C]> App : [result] compiled resolver, or startup error
App -[#1565C0]> Store : [call] New(publication store)
App -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] New(filters, sources, queues, dependencies)
opt cluster definitions enabled
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> Store : [call] mark definition source pending
end
App -[#1565C0]> App : [call] OTel meter provider + Prometheus registry\nregister observable gauges before workers
note over Runtime,Inventory
Runtime owns every Kubernetes source stream, including Karta definitions.
Inventory is a synchronous selection helper. It has no watcher or worker.
Reader shares accepted full objects and caches intermediate-owner metadata.
end note

== C. Start workers, source synchronization and HTTP together ==
par Runtime goroutine
  App -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] Run(childContext)
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] start 2 object workers + 2 root workers\nplus 2 control workers at default configuration
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] enqueue control sync; start refresh ticker
else HTTP server goroutine
  App -[#7B1FA2]> App : [decision] serve /metrics, /healthz and /readyz
  Prom -[#1565C0]> App : [call] GET /readyz
  App -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] Ready()
  Runtime --[#388E3C]> App : [result] false until required sources ready / fresh
  App --[#388E3C]> Prom : [result] 503 initially; /healthz returns 200
end
note over Runtime,Store
A queue key is processed once at a time in its queue.
Different roots can reconcile concurrently. Calculation runs outside Runtime's lock.
Publication commit returns under that lock to reject obsolete work.
end note

== D. Establish Kubernetes source streams and their evidence ==
opt cluster definitions enabled
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> Reader : [call] map Karta GVK to resource and scope
  Reader -[#1565C0]> API : [call] API discovery when mapper needs it
  API --[#388E3C]> Reader : [result] GVR and namespaced / cluster scope
  Reader --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] REST mapping
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] ensureWatch(Karta, discover=true)\ncreate SharedIndexInformer and callbacks
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> API : [call] full-object LIST; then WATCH\nclient-go may negotiate initial watch events
  API --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [event] Karta full objects / add / update / delete
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] retain read sequence and failure epoch\nLIST proof expires at read-start + maxAge
  Runtime -[#1565C0]> Reader : [call] accept full objects with source proof\nstrip managedFields; preserve UID / RV / owner refs
end
note over API,Reader
LIST/WATCH callbacks belong to Runtime. sourceObject keeps provenance outside Kubernetes fields.
A delayed callback does not receive a fresh lifetime just because it was delivered late.
ResourceVersion (RV) is checked for equality; it is not compared numerically across resources.
end note

