Inventory -[#7B1FA2]> Inventory : [decision] winning cluster Karta takes precedence\notherwise selected built-in catalog Karta
alt selected winner invalid
  Inventory --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] invalid_definition; do not pick a losing fallback
else winner valid
  Inventory --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] Selection{Definition, GVK, Origin}\nexample catalog JobSet v1alpha2
end
opt namespaceSelector configured
