  API --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [event] namespace labels
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] create namespaced watches only for matching namespaces
end
Runtime -[#1565C0]> Runtime : [call] ensure Pod, selected-definition and RequiredKinds watches\nplus watches needed by existing roots
Runtime -[#1565C0]> API : [call] full Pod and JobSet LIST/WATCH\nexample includes only the JobSet catalog definition
