Runtime -[#1565C0]> Labels : [call] resolve(karta_workload_status, nil Pod)
Labels -[#1565C0]> Labels : [call] configured CEL on object=JobSet\nexample object.metadata.labels["team"] -> platform
Labels --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] status labels and per-label errors

== M. Map each changed Pod, then resolve its custom labels ==
Runtime -[#1565C0]> Reader : [call] Cached(Pod pod-1); validate path evidence again
Reader --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] full Pod p10; live Pod->Job->JobSet proofs
Runtime -[#1565C0]> SDK : [call] mapPod(factory, summary, full Pod)
SDK -[#1565C0]> SDK : [call] NewPodQuerier(Pod); InferPodComponent(summary)
SDK -[#7B1FA2]> SDK : [decision] JobSet definition has one Pod-bearing leaf\ncomponent = replicatedjob
SDK -[#1565C0]> SDK : [call] component instance IDs on JobSet:\n.spec.replicatedJobs[].name -> [worker]
SDK -[#1565C0]> SDK : [call] instance selector on Pod labels:\njobset.sigs.k8s.io/replicatedjob-name -> worker
SDK -[#7B1FA2]> SDK : [decision] require selected instance to belong to root's IDs
