end

== Q. Discovery, API and evaluation failures retain honest validity ==
alt owner read Forbidden / Unauthorized
  API --[#388E3C]> Reader : [result] permission error
  Reader -[#1565C0]> Store : [call] invalidate metadata proof; record permission_denied
  Reader --[#388E3C]> Discovery : [result] owner unavailable
  Discovery --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] fail discovery; no guessed root
else missing / replaced / malformed owner or cycle
  Discovery --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] unresolved or stale chain; do not invent a root
else root status JQ / condition extraction fails
  SDK --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] evaluation error
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] retain compatible previous workload status\nwith invalid status evidence, if available
else changed Pod mapping evaluation fails
  SDK --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] component / instance / replica-selector error
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] new row has unknown component / instance\ncache error reason when input sources are otherwise usable
else custom CEL label fails
  Labels --[#388E3C]> Runtime : [result] per-label error; continue other labels / source fallback
  Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] record evaluation_failed health; retain usable other output
end
Runtime -[#1565C0]> Store : [call] source / path failures revoke live dependencies immediately
Runtime -[#7B1FA2]> Runtime : [decision] returned queue errors retry with 10ms..10s backoff\nForget after success; cancellation does not retry
note over Runtime,Store #FCE4EC
Not every evaluation error is a queue error: some are published as failed evidence.
Known values are not converted into a fake application Failed state.
Without a previous successful status there may be no status series to retain.
A first unresolved Pod has no confirmed root publication to fabricate.
end note

